OL,3,GNEWSAScammers are exploiting AI
OL,4,Atechnology, PCC warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FScams involving AI-generated voice
OL,7,Fcloning have become prevalent in recent
OL,8,Fmonths, according to Surrey's police
OL,9,Fand crime commissioner.
OL,11,FPCC Lisa Townsend demonstrated the
OL,12,Ftechnology with an AI replica of her
OL,13,Fvoice amid efforts to educate the
OL,14,Fpublic about the dangers scammers pose
OL,15,F- and to warn that anyone could be
OL,16,Fvulnerable, especially in the lead-up
OL,17,Fto Christmas.
OL,19,FResidents in Surrey say scammers who
OL,20,Fhave targeted them have become "very
OL,21,Fsophisticated".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
