OL,3,GNEWSAScammers are exploiting AI
OL,4,Atechnology, PCC warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FTownsend told BBC Radio Surrey: "We
OL,7,Fknow that criminals are absolutely
OL,8,Fcapable and willing to exploit new
OL,9,Ftechnology."
